function realSourceSaveProfileViewState(profileId=realSourceUI.profileId){if(!profileId)return;realSourceUI.catalogProfiles[profileId]={catalogObjects:realSourceUI.catalogObjects.slice(),catalogComplete:realSourceUI.catalogComplete,catalogNextCursor:realSourceUI.catalogNextCursor,catalogPageCount:realSourceUI.catalogPageCount,catalogSchemaOptions:realSourceUI.catalogSchemaOptions.slice(),catalogSelectedSchemas:realSourceUI.catalogSelectedSchemas.slice(),catalogSelectedObjects:realSourceUI.catalogSelectedObjects.map(o=>({...o})),batchResults:realSourceUI.batchResults.slice(),metadataSchemaFilter:realSourceUI.metadataSchemaFilter.slice(),metadataTableFilter:realSourceUI.metadataTableFilter.slice(),catalogSchemaSearch:realSourceUI.catalogSchemaSearch,catalogObjectSearch:realSourceUI.catalogObjectSearch,catalogTypeFilter:realSourceUI.catalogTypeFilter,catalogPageSize:realSourceUI.catalogPageSize,catalogVisiblePage:realSourceUI.catalogVisiblePage,schema:realSourceUI.schema,table:realSourceUI.table,objectType:realSourceUI.objectType,metadata:realSourceUI.metadata,sample:null};}
